{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t港股跌幅擴大至逾500點，恒生指數低見23143點，較早時報23195點，跌455點，跌幅1.93%。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n科技指數報3864點，跌130點，跌幅3.26%。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n金融、地產和公用股分類指數都跌逾1%。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：宋家樑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T02:21:51.909187+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T02:05:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T03:37:55.635115+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T02:17:53.105174+00:00","content_hash":"d6f34ded047196e074c261074932d6e0cb070359b8e03ea0381e26b61388276e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}